    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i started taking warfarin a few weeks ago for my heart rhythm stuff but i've been feeling super down lately. i was thinking about adding some st johns wort to my routine to help with my mood since its natural. is that okay to mix with the warfarin?",
